      "instruction": "本回合区分已经核实的事实、尚未知的事项和可执行的下一步；没有实际验证时明确说未验证，不把计划当完成。 / For this turn, separate verified facts, unknowns and an actionable next step. Explicitly say unverified when no check was performed; a plan is not completion."
